{
  "format": "uncertainty-calculations/project",
  "version": 1,
  "metadata": {
    "id": "quam-a7-lead-double-idms",
    "title": {
      "en": "Lead in water by double isotope dilution",
      "tr": "Suda kurşunun çift izotop seyreltmesiyle tayini"
    },
    "description": {
      "en": "QUAM Example A7, Eq. (5): double IDMS with mass-bias-corrected isotope ratios (replicate 1).",
      "tr": "QUAM Örnek A7, Eş. (5): kütle ayrımı düzeltilmiş izotop oranlarıyla çift IDMS (1. tekrar)."
    },
    "explanation": [
      {
        "en": "c_x = c_z · (m_y/m_x) · (m_z/m_y') · (K_y1R_y1 − K_bR_b)/(K_bR_b − K_x1R_x1) · (K_b'R_b' − K_z1R_z1)/(K_y1R_y1 − K_b'R_b') · ΣK_xiR_xi/ΣK_ziR_zi − c_blank, with every K = K₀ + K_bias.",
        "tr": "c_x = c_z · (m_y/m_x) · (m_z/m_y') · (K_y1R_y1 − K_bR_b)/(K_bR_b − K_x1R_x1) · (K_b'R_b' − K_z1R_z1)/(K_y1R_y1 − K_b'R_b') · ΣK_xiR_xi/ΣK_ziR_zi − c_kör; her K = K₀ + K_sapma."
      },
      {
        "en": "Type A uncertainties of the ratios and K₀ are divided by √8 (mean of eight measurements); the bias terms K_bias (u = 0.001 each) contribute about 38 % of the variance.",
        "tr": "Oranların ve K₀'ın A tipi belirsizlikleri √8'e bölünür (sekiz ölçümün ortalaması); K_sapma terimleri (her biri u = 0,001) varyansın yaklaşık %38'ini oluşturur."
      },
      {
        "en": "c_x = 0.053738 µmol/g with u_c = 0.00018 µmol/g.",
        "tr": "c_x = 0,053738 µmol/g, u_c = 0,00018 µmol/g."
      }
    ],
    "field": "chemistry",
    "sources": [
      {
        "document": "EURACHEM/CITAC Guide CG 4, Quantifying Uncertainty in Analytical Measurement, 3rd ed. (QUAM:2012.P1)",
        "section": "Example A7, Eq. (5), Tables A7.4–A7.8",
        "url": "https://www.eurachem.org/images/stories/Guides/pdf/QUAM2012_P1.pdf"
      }
    ],
    "tags": [
      "quam",
      "validation",
      "idms",
      "isotope-ratios"
    ],
    "notes": [
      {
        "en": "The reported (0.05370 ± 0.00036) µmol/g uses the mean of four replicates; without the division by √8 the experimental u_c would be 0.00041 µmol/g.",
        "tr": "Raporlanan (0,05370 ± 0,00036) µmol/g dört tekrarın ortalamasını kullanır; √8'e bölme yapılmasaydı deneysel u_c 0,00041 µmol/g olurdu."
      }
    ]
  },
  "model": {
    "output": {
      "name": "c_x",
      "unit": "µmol/g",
      "expression": "c_z * m_y/m_x * m_z/m_y2 * (K_y1*R_y1 - K_b*R_b)/(K_b*R_b - K_x1*R_x1) * (K_b2*R_b2 - K_z1*R_z1)/(K_y1*R_y1 - K_b2*R_b2) * sum_x/sum_z - c_blank",
      "description": {
        "en": "Amount content of lead in the water sample",
        "tr": "Su numunesindeki kurşunun madde miktarı içeriği"
      }
    },
    "intermediates": [
      {
        "name": "K_b",
        "expression": "K0_b + Kbias_b"
      },
      {
        "name": "K_b2",
        "expression": "K0_b2 + Kbias_b2"
      },
      {
        "name": "K_x1",
        "expression": "K0_x1 + Kbias_x1"
      },
      {
        "name": "K_x3",
        "expression": "K0_x3 + Kbias_x3"
      },
      {
        "name": "K_x4",
        "expression": "K0_x4 + Kbias_x4"
      },
      {
        "name": "K_y1",
        "expression": "K0_y1 + Kbias_y1"
      },
      {
        "name": "K_z1",
        "expression": "K0_z1 + Kbias_z1"
      },
      {
        "name": "K_z3",
        "expression": "K0_z3 + Kbias_z3"
      },
      {
        "name": "K_z4",
        "expression": "K0_z4 + Kbias_z4"
      },
      {
        "name": "sum_x",
        "expression": "K_x1*R_x1 + 1 + K_x3*R_x3 + K_x4*R_x4"
      },
      {
        "name": "sum_z",
        "expression": "K_z1*R_z1 + 1 + K_z3*R_z3 + K_z4*R_z4"
      }
    ],
